## ContentSeeder resumability state (machine-generated, not seed content)
data/seed-json/*.checkpoint.json

## ContentSeeder synthesized-audio cache (Phase G) — local re-run cache so repeat seeding never
## re-spends TTS quota on an already-synthesized passage; the real Gemini-TTS-derived binaries are
## too large to commit (76MB+ for 180 short WAV clips and growing). The durable, committed source of
## truth for this content is the transcript text in data/seed-json/listening-seed.json — the audio
## itself lives in MinIO (or your configured file storage) once seeded, same as any other resource's
## audio. Re-synthesizing from the committed transcripts reproduces this cache exactly if it's ever
## lost locally.
data/seed-audio/
node_modules/
src/LinguaCoach.Web/dist/
.gstack/
src/LinguaCoach.Web/playwright-report/
graphify-out/*
docs/design/*